  "details": "1. I turn on my personal mirror and change avatar scale 2. Avatar now appears differently scaled than normal 2. Close and reopen mirror 3. Avatar appears as normal. I do not like this change and would like this to be reverted. I prefer when the personal mirror would scale with my avatar scaling and do not like having to reopen my mirror to have my avatar appear back at normal scale at a changed scale. Update: [1495] Personal Mirrors are still unscalable and still don't scale with my avatar scale changes. Still requires turning off Personal Mirror and turning it back on. Please fix this and make it rescale with avatar scaling. This is very unfun to deal with. [1506] Still broken, so the issue is persistent on desktop mode but works fine in VR. Mirror scales with avatar scaling in VR but doesn't do so on Desktop mode. It's Probably why no one is reporting this issue because it's a Desktop issue.",
